  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past on">Past</span><span class="tw present">Present</span><span class="tw future">Future</span></div>
        <h1>Your framing doesn't have to be <em>your foundation.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Fretwork reads the systems you inherited — in a company or in a life — and rebuilds them so the present can work.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a systems read</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#how">How it works</a></div>
        <p class="welcome">Welcome to Fretwork — <b>Learn</b></p>
      </div>
      <div class="proof"><div class="wrap proof-grid"><div><b>7</b><span>Workflow points we read</span></div><div><b>30</b><span>Days to a rebuilt system</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>Human sign-off on everything</span></div><div><b>5</b><span>Chambers read, for people</span></div></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec" id="why"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The problem</p><h2>The work leaks between the apps.<br>The life leaks between the stories.</h2></div>
      <div class="pains"><div class="pain"><h3>Inherited</h3><p>You run on tools and habits someone else set up.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Disconnected</h3><p>Nothing talks to anything. You are the glue.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Unread</h3><p>Nobody has mapped how it actually flows.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="russ"><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-bw.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">The connector</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">Twenty years running organizations on Microsoft 365, Power Automate and the people in between. He reads the wiring first.</p><blockquote>Sometimes we meet life where it is, not where we are. We hold that together.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.vaulthuman.com/writing">Writing</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Read. Rebuild. Hand off.</h2></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>The read</h3><p>We map the seven points where work or life actually flows.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>The rebuild</h3><p>Fixed scope. Connected tools, workflows and AI.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>The hand-off</h3><p>Your team runs it. For people, your coach at Triplicity gets the read.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">For teams and for people</p><h2>Two ways in.</h2></div>
      <div class="offers"><div class="offer feat"><div class="tag">Teams</div><h3>The Systems Read</h3><div class="price">Fixed fee</div><p>A full read of your tools, workflows and hand-offs. A plan you own.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book the read</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">Teams</div><h3>The Rebuild</h3><div class="price">By scope</div><p>We connect, automate and hand off. No year-long engagement.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" data-open-form>Ask</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">People</div><h3>The Past, Read</h3><div class="price">Included</div><p>Chambers One to Five, read as wiring, handed to your coach. Part of the Coached Year.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Learn more</a></div></div>
      
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="family"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Learn · Love · Live</p><h2>Fretwork is the past.</h2><p class="lede">Learn from the past. Love the present. Live for the future.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown me" href="https://www.fretworksystems.com"><div class="when">Learn · The past</div><h3>Fretwork</h3><p>Reads the systems you inherited and rebuilds them.</p><span>fretworksystems.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc green" href="https://triplicityadvisory.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Love · The present</div><h3>Triplicity</h3><p>The coaching company. A coach reads your log for a year.</p><span>triplicityadvisory.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc navy" href="https://www.tercetlaw.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Live · The future</div><h3>Tercet</h3><p>Estate and life-law planning. The documents a life is lived on.</p><span>tercetlaw.com ↗</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">The Constant: <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What does Fretwork actually do?</summary><p>Reads how your work or life flows, then rebuilds the systems under it.</p></details><details><summary>Do you replace our tools?</summary><p>No. We connect the ones you have.</p></details><details><summary>Who signs off?</summary><p>A human, on everything that ships.</p></details><details><summary>What is 'the past'?</summary><p>Your framing and foundation. We read it so coaching can work on the present.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final" id="begin"><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Read the wiring.</h2><p class="lede">A thirty-minute call. We tell you what we see.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a systems read</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>
